{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>In Jacob's tent.</b> It is Rachel's tent, for Jacob was constantly with her; and so it says, ״the sons of Rachel, Jacob's wife,״ and regarding all the others it does not say ״Jacob's wife.״" "<b>And he came into Rachel's tent.</b> When he went out from Leah's tent he returned to Rachel's tent before searching in the maidservants' tent — and all this, why? For he recognized that she was serving him."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:31.358826071Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}